1. DEFINITIONS
================================================================================

1.1. "Licensor" means the copyright holder operating under the name pkoryaka,
     whose official contact channel is identified in Section 16.

1.2. "Licensee" means the individual accepting this Agreement personally, or
     the single legal entity on whose behalf this Agreement is accepted.
     Affiliates are not automatically included within that legal entity.

1.3. "Software" means NativeLingo as distributed by Licensor, including its
     executable files, scripts, proprietary source code where supplied,
     native utilities, including CopyNative, libraries, interface assets,
     documentation, and accompanying updates. Third-Party Components are
     subject to Section 8.

1.4. "Personal and Non-Commercial Use" means use by an individual human being
     for private personal productivity, personal communication, unpaid
     nonprofit or charitable activities, study, learning, teaching, or
     non-commercial academic research, and not for the business operations
     of a Commercial Entity or the provision of paid services.

     Ordinary payment of an educator's salary or a student's scholarship
     does not, by itself, disqualify otherwise eligible educational use
     under Section 3.

1.5. "Commercial Entity" means a corporation, partnership, sole
     proprietorship, governmental body, association, or other organization
     using the Software for business, professional, administrative, or
     institutional operations. It includes a self-employed individual and
     any employee or contractor acting for such an organization. An
     organization's nonprofit status does not, by itself, exempt its
     operational deployment from commercial licensing.

1.6. "Commercial Use" means use for business operations, employment-related
     business productivity, paid professional services, work for hire,
     commercial translation, revenue-generating activities, or organizational
     administration, except for use expressly exempted under Section 3.
     Classification depends on the purpose of use, not device ownership,
     the user's location, or whether a particular activity earns a profit.

1.7. "Evaluation Version" means the official, unregistered Software used by a
     Commercial Entity under the temporary evaluation license in Section 2.
     The same distribution may also be used without registration for the
     free uses authorized in Section 3.

1.8. "Registered Version" means the Software to the extent its Commercial
     Use is covered by a valid, paid commercial entitlement issued or
     expressly authorized by Licensor. Registration need not involve a
     separate executable or different functionality.

1.9. "Order" means a quotation, order form, license certificate, or other
     commercial licensing instrument accepted in writing by Licensor that
     identifies the Licensee, license tier, quantity, scope, fees, and any
     applicable license term.

1.10. "Authorized User" means an individual permitted to use the Software
      within the scope of Licensee's entitlement. Licensee is responsible
      for Authorized Users' compliance when acting on Licensee's behalf.

1.11. "Affiliate" means an entity that controls, is controlled by, or is under
      common control with Licensee, where control means ownership of more
      than fifty percent of voting interests or equivalent governing power.

1.12. "Third-Party Components" means software, libraries, models, or other
      materials owned by third parties and supplied under separate license
