3. FREE PERSONAL, NONPROFIT, AND EDUCATIONAL USE
================================================================================

3.1. Free Perpetual Individual License.
     Subject to this Agreement, Licensor grants each individual human
     user a non-exclusive, royalty-free, perpetual license to install
     and use the Software for Personal and Non-Commercial Use on an
     unlimited number of devices that the individual is authorized to use.

     This license is 100 percent free, does not require commercial
     registration, and is not subject to the 40-day evaluation limit.
     "Perpetual" means without a fixed expiration date, subject to
     termination for breach under Section 13.

3.2. Student and Educational Exemption.
     Students and educators may use the Software without charge for
     learning, classroom instruction, and non-commercial academic
     research. Schools and academic institutions may install the
     Software on classroom or laboratory devices for those purposes,
     including shared educational workstations.

     This exemption does not cover institutional administration,
     commercial consulting, paid translation services, or research
     conducted primarily to deliver proprietary commercial results
     to a business customer.

3.3. Nonprofit Activities.
     Individual unpaid charitable and nonprofit activities qualify
     under Section 3.1. General organizational deployment by a charity,
     nonprofit organization, or government body requires a commercial
     license unless covered by Section 3.2 or separately authorized
     by Licensor in writing.

3.4. Mixed Use.
     Personal eligibility does not exempt business use of the same
     installation. Commercial Use must independently satisfy Section 2
     or Section 4.

